1
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:16,175
IN TENEBRIS LUX UNA
in darkness, one light

2
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:29,300
CIRCUMIT ET CIRCULUM FACIT
it goes around, and makes a circle

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,650
NONAGINTA LUMINA
ninety lights

4
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:41,650
QUATERNIS GRADIBUS
four degrees apart

5
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:53,650
TREDECIM TREDECIM ET ITERUM TREDECIM
thirteen, thirteen, and again thirteen

6
00:00:53,700 --> 00:01:05,650
UNA SOLA ARDET OMNES LUCENT
one alone burns — all of them shine

7
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:11,650
AUDIT TE AUDIT TE
it hears you

8
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:17,650
CANTA ET RESPONDEBIT
sing, and it will answer

9
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:23,650
DECEM FILA NONAGINTA FLAMMAE
ten threads, ninety flames

10
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:29,650
MILIES IN SECUNDO
a thousand times each second

11
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:35,650
OCTO BITORUM COR
a heart of eight bits

12
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:41,650
UNA SOLA ARDET
one alone burns

13
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:47,650
QUINDECIM SORTES UNA LUX
fifteen lots, one light

14
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:53,650
EX NUMMO PARVO VIVIT
it lives on a small coin

15
00:01:53,700 --> 00:02:00,800
CENTUM ET NOVEM HORAS
for a hundred and nine hours

16
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:11,650
LIBER ET APERTUS
free and open

17
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:17,650
OMNIBUS DATUS EST
it is given to all

18
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:23,650
MUTA FRANGE RESCRIBE
change it, break it, rewrite it

19
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:35,650
UNA SOLA ARDET OMNES LUCENT
one alone burns — all of them shine

20
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:41,650
TENE ET DORMIET
hold, and it will sleep

21
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:51,000
AMEN
amen

